        "description": "<p>This plugin lets you add the Yappr chat widget to your website.</p>\n<p>Go to Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Yappr Chat Widget and enter your Yappr Widget ID. The plugin loads the widget automatically.</p>\n",
