        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Use Widget ID and load widget script via WordPress enqueue.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
